A, \r\n<br>HEREBY PROCLAIMS HIS BENEVOLENT \r\n<br>RULE FROM HIS SEAT OF POWER ON \r\n<br>HEXWELL ISLAND! ALL ARE SUMMONED \r\n<br>TO HIS MAGNIFICENT PALACE TO WITNESS \r\n<br>HIS CORONATION. COME! BOW BEFORE \r\n<br>HIM AND PAY TRIBUTE!</em>"},{"name":"Property","displayName":"Property","value":"Aladdin"}]},{"productId":711215,"name":"Reign of Jafar Lore Card (2 of 19)","cleanName":"Reign of Jafar Lore Card 2 of 19","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/711215_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24258,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/711215/lorcana-tcg-reign-of-jafar-reign-of-jafar-lore-card-2-of-19","modifiedOn":"2026-08-13T15:02:29.663","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"Have you looked outside?\" Martin said, peering out the window of Archazia's library. Venturo and Shanzay joined him and gasped. \"Is that a wave... of sand?\" Martin pointed to something sweeping across the tranquil forests of Hexwell Island. As it passed, trees twisted and cracked, and the landscape transformed. <br>\"Get Archazia. Hurry!\" Shanzay told Martin, unable to take her eyes off the magical wave of sand. He dashed off."}]},{"productId":711216,"name":"Reign of Jafar Lore Card (3 of 19)","cleanName":"Reign of Jafar Lore Card 3 of 19","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/711216_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24258,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/711216/lorcana-tcg-reign-of-jafar-reign-of-jafar-lore-card-3-of-19","modifiedOn":"2026-08-13T15:20:03.623","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"While waiting for Martin to return with Archazia, Shanzay and Venturo watched as the island was overtaken by forceful magic and remade into something dry and barren with marble-and-gold buildings of garish opulence. \r\n<br>\"This is so wrong,\" said Shanzay. \r\n<br>Moments later, Martin returned, breathless and clutching Archazia's inkcaster. \"She's... she's...\" He leaned over the magical staff, panting and scrubbing sand from his eyes. \"She's gone.\""},{"name":"Property","displayName":"Property","value":"Aladdin"}]},{"productId":711217,"name":"Reign of Jafar Lore Card (4 of 19)","cleanName":"Reign of Jafar Lore Card 4 of 19","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/711217_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24258,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/711217/lorcana-tcg-reign-of-jafar-reign-of-jafar-lore-card-4-of-19","modifiedOn":"2026-08-13T15:23:27.853","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"<em><strong>BE IT KNOWN</strong>\r\n<br>HIGH SULTAN JAFAR, LORD OF \r\n<br>LORCANA, HEREBY PROCLAIMS THAT \r\n<br>THE ILLUMINEER WHO CALLS HERSELF \r\n<br>\"THE OWL\" HAS COME TO THE ROYAL \r\n<br>PALACE OF HER OWN VOLITION FOR HER \r\n<br>PERSONAL PROTECTION. SHE IS NOW \r\n<br>ASSISTING HIGH SULTAN JAFAR WITH \r\n<br>MATTERS OF GREAT CONSEQUENCE. THIS \r\n<br>CRUCIAL WORK IS NOT TO BE DISTURBED!</em>"},{"name":"Property","displayName":"Property","value":"Aladdin"}]},{"productId":711218,"name":"Reign of Jafar Lore Card (5 of 19)","cleanName":"Reign of Jafar Lore Card 5 of 19","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/711218_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24258,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/711218/lorcana-tcg-reign-of-jafar-reign-of-jafar-lore-card-5-of-19","modifiedOn":"2026-08-13T15:31:28.963","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"There are fliers and goons everywhere outside. Jafar says Archazia's working with him, but I doubt it,\" said Martin. \r\n<br>\"You think?\" Shanzay looked around, then grabbed a thought scroll. \"She must have <em>something</em> that could help us find her.\" \r\n<br>After an hour or two of desperate searching, Venturo whispered excitedly, \"I found schematics of the palace! Look!\" \r\n<br>Shanzay looked it over. \"Oh yeah, this'll work.\""}]},{"productId":711219,"name":"Reign of Jafar Lore Card (6 of 19)","cleanName":"Reign of Jafar Lore Card 6 of 19","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/711219_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24258,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/711219/lorcana-tcg-reign-of-jafar-reign-of-jafar-lore-card-6-of-19","modifiedOn":"2026-08-13T15:33:03.75","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"As they pored over the schematics, slowly a plan came together. They'd dodge the Jafar glimmer's guards between the library and palace, then sneak in through a tunnel system underneath the building. From there, they could enter the Armory through a hidden hatch and make a break to rescue Archazia from her former workshop. \r\n<br>As they were leaving, Venturo turned to Martin. \"Bring Archazia's inkcaster. She might need it.\""}]},{"productId":711220,"name":"Reign of Jafar Lore Card (7 of 19)","cleanName":"Reign of Jafar Lore Card 7 of 19","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/711220_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24258,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/711220/lorcana-tcg-reign-of-jafar-reign-of-jafar-lore-card-7-of-19","modifiedOn":"2026-08-13T15:39:50.903","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"\"Are we sure the tunnels in those schematics are safe?\" Martin asked as they dashed to Jafar's palace, the sand wave not far behind them as it continued to sweep over the island. \r\n<br>\"No choice!\" Shanzay said. \"Look—the entrance is just ahead.\" \r\n<br>\"Complete with a palace guard.\" Venturo shaded his eyes. \"I bet that's one of Jafar's illusions. See the light patterns shifting?\" \r\n<br>Shanzay blew out a breath. \"Okay, so what now?\""}]},{"productId":711221,"name":"Reign of Jafar Lore Card (8 of 19)","cleanName":"Reign of Jafar Lore Card 8 of 19","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/711221_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24258,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/711221/lorcana-tcg-reign-of-jafar-reign-of-jafar-lore-card-8-of-19","modifiedOn":"2026-08-13T15:49:32.867","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"The guard spotted them and yelled. Martin stepped forward. \"Lemme try something...\" \r\n<br>He strummed a few heroic notes on his inkcaster as the sand wave roared ever closer. With the final flourish, a Bolt glimmer took shape. The dog growled at the guard illusion and pierced him with an intense stare. To Venturo's surprise, the guard disappeared in a burst of misty light. \r\n<br>\"Nice work!\" Venturo shouted. Grinning, Martin tousled Bolt's white fur."}]},{"productId":711226,"name":"Reign of Jafar Lore Card (9 of 19)","cleanName":"Reign of Jafar Lore Card 9 of 19","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/711226_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24258,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/711226/lorcana-tcg-reign-of-jafar-reign-of-jafar-lore-card-9-of-19","modifiedOn":"2026-08-13T15:57:55.653","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"\"Guys, there are tiny footprints in the sand here leading away.\" Martin stopped short at the entrance to the tunnel. \"If they're from the Basil glimmer, they might they lead us to Archazia.\" \r\n<br>\"We don't know that,\" Shanzay said. \"And we can't risk indulging your curiosity again after the Ursula disaster. Come on!\" \r\n<br>Martin glowered but dove in after her just as the sand wave reached them."}]},{"productId":711227,"name":"Reign of Jafar Lore Card (10 of 19)","cleanName":"Reign of Jafar Lore Card 10 of 19","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/711227_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24258,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/711227/lorcana-tcg-reign-of-jafar-reign-of-jafar-lore-card-10-of-19","modifiedOn":"2026-08-13T16:01:48.777","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"<em><strong>BE IT KNOWN</strong>\r\n<br>UNDER PAIN OF BANISHMENT FROM THE \r\n<br>KINGDOM, ILLUMINEERS AND GLIMMERS \r\n<br>ARE COMMANDED TO PRESENT TO HIGH \r\n<br>SULTAN JAFAR ALL OF THE ILLUMINEER \r\n<br>ARCHAZIA'S MAGICAL ITEMS OF POWER, \r\n<br>TO BE KEPT SAFELY IN HIS PALACE.</em>"},{"name":"Property","displayName":"Property","value":"Aladdin"}]},{"productId":711228,"name":"Reign of Jafar Lore Card (11 of 19)","cleanName":"Reign of Jafar Lore Card 11 of 19","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/711228_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24258,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/711228/lorcana-tcg-reign-of-jafar-reign-of-jafar-lore-card-11-of-19","modifiedOn":"2026-08-13T16:07:45.78","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"After what seemed like hours in the tunnels, the Illumineers found a room stuffed with treasures. \r\n<br>“Man, he's greedy,” Venturo said. \r\n<br>“Maybe,” Shanzay said. “Except he specified Archazia's inventions.\" <br>Venturo's eyes widened. “Hold on . . .” he said. \"Jafar wants to be all-powerful, right? Who's more powerful than Illumineers in Lorcana? Especially Archazia?” He nodded at the Owl's inkcaster in Martin's hands. “I think I know what he's after.\""}]},{"productId":711229,"name":"Reign of Jafar Lore Card (12 of 19)","cleanName":"Reign of Jafar Lore Card 12 of 19","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/711229_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24258,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/711229/lorcana-tcg-reign-of-jafar-reign-of-jafar-lore-card-12-of-19","modifiedOn":"2026-08-13T16:10:09.77","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"Martin didn't hear Venturo—he was staring at the floor. \"Look! More tiny tracks! Leading into the maze.\" \r\n<br>\"No,\" said Shanzay. \"Archazia's workshop is the other way.\" \r\n<br>Martin turned to her. \"The Basil glimmer has been under Jafar's power for a while, and the whole Island is different now. Following Basil could be more reliable than depending on her schematics.\" \r\n<br>Nodding, Venturo said, \"Martin has a point.\" \r\n<br>Shanzay shrugged. \"Fine.\""},{"name":"Property","displayName":"Property","value":"Aladdin"}]},{"productId":711230,"name":"Reign of Jafar Lore Card (13 of 19)","cleanName":"Reign of Jafar Lore Card 13 of 19","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/711230_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24258,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/711230/lorcana-tcg-reign-of-jafar-reign-of-jafar-lore-card-13-of-19","modifiedOn":"2026-08-13T16:13:37.513","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"Thanks to Basil's footprints, the Illumineers navigated the maze quickly until they came upon the mouse glimmer himself standing in the path looking confused. <br>\"Basil!\" Martin dropped down. \"What are you doing?\" \r\n<br>Basil wrung his tiny hands. \"I took a spill and hit my head. The last thing I remember was seeing a rather <em>large</em> owl trapped in an hourglass.\" <br>Shanzay glanced guiltily at Martin and then answered, \"Can you show us?\""}]},{"productId":711231,"name":"Reign of Jafar Lore Card (14 of 19)","cleanName":"Reign of Jafar Lore Card 14 of 19","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/711231_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24258,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/711231/lorcana-tcg-reign-of-jafar-reign-of-jafar-lore-card-14-of-19","modifiedOn":"2026-08-13T16:16:30.05","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"Basil led them to a nearby room and waved toward the door. \"It's through there. I'm still rather unsteady, so I'd best wait here.\" \r\n<br>The Illumineers peered through the door. A twenty-foot hourglass dominated the chamber, guarded by an enormous metal scorpion whose tail was half that height. Inside the lower half of the hourglass, surrounded by rising sand, they could make out the green-clad shape of a familiar owl. \r\n<br>\"Archazia!\" Shanzay gasped."}]},{"productId":711232,"name":"Reign of Jafar Lore Card (15 of 19)","cleanName":"Reign of Jafar Lore Card 15 of 19","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/711232_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24258,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/711232/lorcana-tcg-reign-of-jafar-reign-of-jafar-lore-card-15-of-19","modifiedOn":"2026-08-13T16:20:47.13","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"\"We're gonna need backup,\" Martin said, eyeing the giant scorpion. He strummed his inkcaster. \r\n<br>A glimmer of Archimedes materialized. \"I say, is that my fellow owl enthusiast, Archazia?\" \r\n<br>\"Yes.\" Martin pointed with Archazia's inkcaster. \"Distract <em>that</em> while we try to free her!\" \r\n<br>The smaller owl hooted, then zipped around the scorpion. The colossus lumbered in chase, slipping wildly on the marble."}]},{"productId":711233,"name":"Reign of Jafar Lore Card (16 of 19)","cleanName":"Reign of Jafar Lore Card 16 of 19","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/711233_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24258,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/711233/lorcana-tcg-reign-of-jafar-reign-of-jafar-lore-card-16-of-19","modifiedOn":"2026-08-13T16:22:55.803","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"The Archimedes glimmer dove, and the scorpion lunged. Its legs sprawled out and its tail crashed into the hourglass, shattering it. Archazia spilled onto the marble in a sandy flood, then rose and sauntered to the Illumineers. \r\n<br>\"Excuse my absence, dears. It seems I've had too much time on my hands.\" She dusted her feathers and peered at the toppled scorpion. \"Leave that for now. We need a plan to stop that Jafar glimmer.\""}]},{"productId":711234,"name":"Reign of Jafar Lore Card (17 of 19)","cleanName":"Reign of Jafar Lore Card 17 of 19","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/711234_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24258,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/711234/lorcana-tcg-reign-of-jafar-reign-of-jafar-lore-card-17-of-19","modifiedOn":"2026-08-13T16:25:01.207","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"Once back in Archazia's library, Shanzay said, \"I have an idea.\" The others gathered around her. \"Step one,\" she began, glancing at Martin with an apologetic smile, \"trust our friend's instincts. If we'd followed Basil to begin with, we'd be that much closer to getting out of this mess.\" \r\n<br>\"Thanks,\" he said, beaming at her. \"And step two?\" \r\n<br>She rubbed her hands together and said with a sly grin, \"Trick that Jafar glimmer and retrieve the Hexwell Crown.\""}]},{"productId":711235,"name":"Reign of Jafar Lore Card (18 of 19)","cleanName":"Reign of Jafar Lore Card 18 of 19","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/711235_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24258,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/711235/lorcana-tcg-reign-of-jafar-reign-of-jafar-lore-card-18-of-19","modifiedOn":"2026-08-13T16:27:57.91","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"Archazia wistfully watched their exchange, then closed her eyes. \"I never should have let things fester with my friend long ago,\" she said in a low voice. Squaring her shoulders, she looked at Shanzay. \"No matter. How can we trick him long enough to distract from our efforts?\" \r\n<br>Venturo snapped his fingers. \"I've got it! We think Jafar's after your inkcaster. He wants to have the power of Illumineers for himself.\" \r\n<br>Their mentor chuckled. \"Truly! Perhaps we should gift it to him as a peace offering, then. Come, I have a plan.\""}]},{"productId":711236,"name":"Reign of Jafar Lore Card (19 of 19)","cleanName":"Reign of Jafar Lore Card 19 of 19","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/711236_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24258,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/711236/lorcana-tcg-reign-of-jafar-reign-of-jafar-lore-card-19-of-19","modifiedOn":"2026-08-13T16:31:10.643","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"Archazia held out her inkcaster to the Jasmine glimmer chosen to infiltrate Jafar's palace. \"Remember, he thinks this bestows an Illumineer's powers. We know it doesn't, but you must pretend. Distract him while the rest of the team goes for the Hexwell Crown.\" \r\n<br>\"What if he figures out it won't work for him?\" Jasmine asked. \r\n<br>\"Then you'll fight your way out with the Crown. Lorcana is counting on you—Jafar's reign must end.\""}]}]}